{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71829","main_id":71829,"main_title":"此菜不应人间有","main_description":"望舒客栈的言笑，似乎正在为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"此菜不应人间有","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7182902,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7182902,"sequence":0,"variant":0,"line_id":718290201,"next_line_ids":[],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":2204,"speaker_text_hash":2573026253,"speaker":"言笑","speaker_raw":"言笑","text_hash":3751316394,"text":"去桌子那边坐着吧，我做好菜了就端过来。","raw_text":"去桌子那边坐着吧，我做好菜了就端过来。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7182902.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71829","main_id":71829,"main_title":"此菜不应人间有","main_description":"望舒客栈的言笑，似乎正在为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"此菜不应人间有","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":7182903,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7182903,"sequence":0,"variant":0,"line_id":718290301,"next_line_ids":[718290302],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":2201,"speaker_text_hash":3933143669,"speaker":"江雪","speaker_raw":"江雪","text_hash":41190274,"text":"咦？您可是位稀客。平日里只有我和那厨子相对无言，今天多了您，说不定也会热闹一些。","raw_text":"咦？您可是位稀客。平日里只有我和那厨子相对无言，今天多了您，说不定也会热闹一些。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7182903.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71829","main_id":71829,"main_title":"此菜不应人间有","main_description":"望舒客栈的言笑，似乎正在为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"此菜不应人间有","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":7182903,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7182903,"sequence":1,"variant":0,"line_id":718290302,"next_line_ids":[],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":2201,"speaker_text_hash":3933143669,"speaker":"江雪","speaker_raw":"江雪","text_hash":855045722,"text":"但我今天看那厨子愁眉苦脸的，也不知道是不是遇见什么烦心事了…","raw_text":"但我今天看那厨子愁眉苦脸的，也不知道是不是遇见什么烦心事了…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7182903.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71829","main_id":71829,"main_title":"此菜不应人间有","main_description":"望舒客栈的言笑，似乎正在为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"此菜不应人间有","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":7182904,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7182904,"sequence":0,"variant":0,"line_id":718290401,"next_line_ids":[718290402],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":2201,"speaker_text_hash":3933143669,"speaker":"江雪","speaker_raw":"江雪","text_hash":891330186,"text":"这狮子头的味道果然不错，这肉入口即化，汤汁也醇厚香浓…","raw_text":"这狮子头的味道果然不错，这肉入口即化，汤汁也醇厚香浓…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7182904.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71829","main_id":71829,"main_title":"此菜不应人间有","main_description":"望舒客栈的言笑，似乎正在为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"此菜不应人间有","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":7182904,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7182904,"sequence":1,"variant":0,"line_id":718290402,"next_line_ids":[718290403],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":2201,"speaker_text_hash":3933143669,"speaker":"江雪","speaker_raw":"江雪","text_hash":598348650,"text":"唔？竟在肉中加入了蟹膏，怪不得尝之鲜美异常。","raw_text":"唔？竟在肉中加入了蟹膏，怪不得尝之鲜美异常。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7182904.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71829","main_id":71829,"main_title":"此菜不应人间有","main_description":"望舒客栈的言笑，似乎正在为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"此菜不应人间有","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":7182904,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7182904,"sequence":2,"variant":0,"line_id":718290403,"next_line_ids":[718290404,718290405,718290407],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":2201,"speaker_text_hash":3933143669,"speaker":"江雪","speaker_raw":"江雪","text_hash":2590508842,"text":"来，旅行者，你也再尝一个。我教你，先用筷子拨开狮子头，再蘸以汤汁，随米饭同嚼…","raw_text":"来，旅行者，你也再尝一个。我教你，先用筷子拨开狮子头，再蘸以汤汁，随米饭同嚼…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7182904.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71829","main_id":71829,"main_title":"此菜不应人间有","main_description":"望舒客栈的言笑，似乎正在为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"此菜不应人间有","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":7182904,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7182904,"sequence":3,"variant":0,"line_id":718290404,"next_line_ids":[718290409],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speaker_id":0,"speaker_text_hash":0,"speaker":"旅行者","speaker_raw":"旅行者","text_hash":2936433602,"text":"客气客气…","raw_text":"客气客气…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7182904.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71829","main_id":71829,"main_title":"此菜不应人间有","main_description":"望舒客栈的言笑，似乎正在为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"此菜不应人间有","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":7182904,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7182904,"sequence":4,"variant":0,"line_id":718290409,"next_line_ids":[718290410],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":2204,"speaker_text_hash":2573026253,"speaker":"言笑","speaker_raw":"言笑","text_hash":2184124282,"text":"你们俩吃好喝好啊，反正我马上就不在这里干活了，你想吃也吃不到了…","raw_text":"你们俩吃好喝好啊，反正我马上就不在这里干活了，你想吃也吃不到了…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7182904.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71829","main_id":71829,"main_title":"此菜不应人间有","main_description":"望舒客栈的言笑，似乎正在为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"此菜不应人间有","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":7182904,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7182904,"sequence":5,"variant":0,"line_id":718290410,"next_line_ids":[718290411],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":2201,"speaker_text_hash":3933143669,"speaker":"江雪","speaker_raw":"江雪","text_hash":2660718194,"text":"不在这里干活…这又是从何说起？","raw_text":"不在这里干活…这又是从何说起？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7182904.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71829","main_id":71829,"main_title":"此菜不应人间有","main_description":"望舒客栈的言笑，似乎正在为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"此菜不应人间有","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":7182904,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7182904,"sequence":6,"variant":0,"line_id":718290411,"next_line_ids":[718290412],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":2201,"speaker_text_hash":3933143669,"speaker":"江雪","speaker_raw":"江雪","text_hash":1269090818,"text":"呀，难不成真是我在你这吃喝太多，惹你被掌柜的嫌弃了？","raw_text":"呀，难不成真是我在你这吃喝太多，惹你被掌柜的嫌弃了？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7182904.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71829","main_id":71829,"main_title":"此菜不应人间有","main_description":"望舒客栈的言笑，似乎正在为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"此菜不应人间有","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":7182904,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7182904,"sequence":7,"variant":0,"line_id":718290412,"next_line_ids":[718290413],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":2201,"speaker_text_hash":3933143669,"speaker":"江雪","speaker_raw":"江雪","text_hash":3388869226,"text":"也不该啊，我也颇钓了好几尾好鱼送进了客栈里，应该能抵了饭钱，而且掌柜的也不是这种小气之人…","raw_text":"也不该啊，我也颇钓了好几尾好鱼送进了客栈里，应该能抵了饭钱，而且掌柜的也不是这种小气之人…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7182904.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71829","main_id":71829,"main_title":"此菜不应人间有","main_description":"望舒客栈的言笑，似乎正在为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"此菜不应人间有","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":7182904,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7182904,"sequence":8,"variant":0,"line_id":718290413,"next_line_ids":[718290414],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":2204,"speaker_text_hash":2573026253,"speaker":"言笑","speaker_raw":"言笑","text_hash":1108339338,"text":"你趁早给我歇了吧，你那几条鱼够谁吃的，最后还不是都进了你的肚子。","raw_text":"你趁早给我歇了吧，你那几条鱼够谁吃的，最后还不是都进了你的肚子。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7182904.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71829","main_id":71829,"main_title":"此菜不应人间有","main_description":"望舒客栈的言笑，似乎正在为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"此菜不应人间有","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":7182904,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7182904,"sequence":9,"variant":0,"line_id":718290414,"next_line_ids":[718290415],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":2201,"speaker_text_hash":3933143669,"speaker":"江雪","speaker_raw":"江雪","text_hash":2224256826,"text":"那究竟是…","raw_text":"那究竟是…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7182904.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71829","main_id":71829,"main_title":"此菜不应人间有","main_description":"望舒客栈的言笑，似乎正在为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"此菜不应人间有","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":7182904,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7182904,"sequence":10,"variant":0,"line_id":718290415,"next_line_ids":[718290416],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":2204,"speaker_text_hash":2573026253,"speaker":"言笑","speaker_raw":"言笑","text_hash":14937986,"text":"唉…算了，我还是和你说吧…","raw_text":"唉…算了，我还是和你说吧…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7182904.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71829","main_id":71829,"main_title":"此菜不应人间有","main_description":"望舒客栈的言笑，似乎正在为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"此菜不应人间有","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":7182904,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7182904,"sequence":11,"variant":0,"line_id":718290416,"next_line_ids":[718290417],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":2201,"speaker_text_hash":3933143669,"speaker":"江雪","speaker_raw":"江雪","text_hash":1701677818,"text":"卖相足、味道好、够大气、显手艺，还要有格调…","raw_text":"卖相足、味道好、够大气、显手艺，还要有格调…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7182904.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71829","main_id":71829,"main_title":"此菜不应人间有","main_description":"望舒客栈的言笑，似乎正在为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"此菜不应人间有","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":7182904,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7182904,"sequence":12,"variant":0,"line_id":718290417,"next_line_ids":[718290418],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":2201,"speaker_text_hash":3933143669,"speaker":"江雪","speaker_raw":"江雪","text_hash":83635002,"text":"哈哈哈，掌柜的这是要你做一道世间不应有的奇菜啊。","raw_text":"哈哈哈，掌柜的这是要你做一道世间不应有的奇菜啊。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7182904.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71829","main_id":71829,"main_title":"此菜不应人间有","main_description":"望舒客栈的言笑，似乎正在为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"此菜不应人间有","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":7182904,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7182904,"sequence":13,"variant":0,"line_id":718290418,"next_line_ids":[718290419],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":2204,"speaker_text_hash":2573026253,"speaker":"言笑","speaker_raw":"言笑","text_hash":2210961338,"text":"你给我笑，你接着笑。我看我走了之后，你还找谁蹭吃蹭喝！","raw_text":"你给我笑，你接着笑。我看我走了之后，你还找谁蹭吃蹭喝！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7182904.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71829","main_id":71829,"main_title":"此菜不应人间有","main_description":"望舒客栈的言笑，似乎正在为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"此菜不应人间有","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":7182904,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7182904,"sequence":14,"variant":0,"line_id":718290419,"next_line_ids":[718290420],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":2201,"speaker_text_hash":3933143669,"speaker":"江雪","speaker_raw":"江雪","text_hash":2815607794,"text":"笑罢了，笑罢了。我说你这个厨子为什么今天愁眉苦脸的，原来是遇见这桩事了。","raw_text":"笑罢了，笑罢了。我说你这个厨子为什么今天愁眉苦脸的，原来是遇见这桩事了。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7182904.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71829","main_id":71829,"main_title":"此菜不应人间有","main_description":"望舒客栈的言笑，似乎正在为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"此菜不应人间有","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":7182904,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7182904,"sequence":15,"variant":0,"line_id":718290420,"next_line_ids":[718290421],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":2204,"speaker_text_hash":2573026253,"speaker":"言笑","speaker_raw":"言笑","text_hash":1897775634,"text":"那可不，也不知道掌柜的怎么就突然异想天开，给我折腾的…","raw_text":"那可不，也不知道掌柜的怎么就突然异想天开，给我折腾的…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7182904.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71829","main_id":71829,"main_title":"此菜不应人间有","main_description":"望舒客栈的言笑，似乎正在为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"此菜不应人间有","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":7182904,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7182904,"sequence":16,"variant":0,"line_id":718290421,"next_line_ids":[718290422],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":2201,"speaker_text_hash":3933143669,"speaker":"江雪","speaker_raw":"江雪","text_hash":1368629866,"text":"唔，你也莫急。虽然我不会做菜，但还真知道一份奇菜的菜谱。","raw_text":"唔，你也莫急。虽然我不会做菜，但还真知道一份奇菜的菜谱。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7182904.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71829","main_id":71829,"main_title":"此菜不应人间有","main_description":"望舒客栈的言笑，似乎正在为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"此菜不应人间有","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":7182904,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7182904,"sequence":17,"variant":0,"line_id":718290422,"next_line_ids":[718290423],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":2201,"speaker_text_hash":3933143669,"speaker":"江雪","speaker_raw":"江雪","text_hash":121964274,"text":"这是我当年在外游历时，偶然在一家大户人家吃到的奇菜，叫做「鸡豆花」。","raw_text":"这是我当年在外游历时，偶然在一家大户人家吃到的奇菜，叫做「鸡豆花」。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7182904.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71829","main_id":71829,"main_title":"此菜不应人间有","main_description":"望舒客栈的言笑，似乎正在为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"此菜不应人间有","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":7182904,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7182904,"sequence":18,"variant":0,"line_id":718290423,"next_line_ids":[718290424],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":2201,"speaker_text_hash":3933143669,"speaker":"江雪","speaker_raw":"江雪","text_hash":3121256266,"text":"此菜「食肉不见肉」，食之嫩如豆花，却又荤香醇厚，极尽鲜美，实为「以荤托素」的奇菜。","raw_text":"此菜「食肉不见肉」，食之嫩如豆花，却又荤香醇厚，极尽鲜美，实为「以荤托素」的奇菜。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7182904.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71829","main_id":71829,"main_title":"此菜不应人间有","main_description":"望舒客栈的言笑，似乎正在为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"此菜不应人间有","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":7182904,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7182904,"sequence":19,"variant":0,"line_id":718290424,"next_line_ids":[718290425,718290428],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":2201,"speaker_text_hash":3933143669,"speaker":"江雪","speaker_raw":"江雪","text_hash":1034989130,"text":"我吃过后十分好奇，便去请教了菜谱过来，不过…我却不擅长做菜，于是这菜谱也只能久压箱底…","raw_text":"我吃过后十分好奇，便去请教了菜谱过来，不过…我却不擅长做菜，于是这菜谱也只能久压箱底…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7182904.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71829","main_id":71829,"main_title":"此菜不应人间有","main_description":"望舒客栈的言笑，似乎正在为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"此菜不应人间有","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":7182904,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7182904,"sequence":20,"variant":0,"line_id":718290425,"next_line_ids":[718290426],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speaker_id":0,"speaker_text_hash":0,"speaker":"旅行者","speaker_raw":"旅行者","text_hash":214475722,"text":"这种菜谱，你是怎么请教到的？","raw_text":"这种菜谱，你是怎么请教到的？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7182904.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71829","main_id":71829,"main_title":"此菜不应人间有","main_description":"望舒客栈的言笑，似乎正在为某事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"此菜不应人间有","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":7182904,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7182904,"sequence":21,"variant":0,"line_id":718290426,"next_line_ids":[718290427],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":2201,"speaker_text_hash":3933143669,"speaker":"江雪","speaker_raw":"江雪","text_hash":1472979954,"text":"嗯…简单来说，当时我帮了那户人家一个忙，他们当时也是设宴请的我。","raw_text":"嗯…简单来说，当时我帮了那户人家一个忙，他们当时也是设宴请的我。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7182904.json"}
